      "en": "Then Simon Peter came, following him, and entered into the tomb. He saw the linen cloths lying,",
      "ko": "시몬 베드로도 따라 와서 무덤에 들어가 보니 세마포가 놓였고",
      "source_text_hash": "5e27a7044124364d7ef6f5d09854f6f36cce6c41b58714dbc361f2096d8bea65",
      "translation_text_hash": "2fee24191c429a817129de1a577fcec31c2ac64e44e7d454038e7dc09653b014",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "시몬 베드로도 따라 와서 무덤에 들어가 보니 세마포가 놓였고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "2fee24191c429a817129de1a577fcec31c2ac64e44e7d454038e7dc09653b014"
      ]
    },
