      "en": "They asked her, “Woman, why are you weeping?” She said to them, “Because they have taken away my Lord, and I don’t know where they have laid him.”",
      "ko": "천사들이 가로되 여자여 어찌하여 우느냐 가로되 사람이 내 주를 가져다가 어디 두었는지 내가 알지 못함이니이다",
      "source_text_hash": "c24816f42e2f4b6a0d322f1227141f162bb88beb6d841969110e7335c98a6647",
