      ],
      "en": "Jesus said to her, “Woman, why are you weeping? Who are you looking for?”She, supposing him to be the gardener, said to him, “Sir, if you have carried him away, tell me where you have laid him, and I will take him away.”",
      "ko": "예수께서 가라사대 여자여 어찌하여 울며 누구를 찾느냐 하시니 마리아는 그가 동산지기인 줄로 알고 가로되 주여 당신이 옮겨 갔거든 어디 두었는지 내게 이르소서 그리하면 내가 가져가리이다",
      "source_text_hash": "8c4825397de0e7affba77fe234df673ae8829990f9c512bac08b17fe9de73628",
      "translation_text_hash": "e136b5e63874110a07a1022cb021ed40c0a8b9a287b14a58286fdbbc2203fcb2",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
