      "en": "Jesus said to her, “Mary.”She turned and said to him, “Rabboni!” which is to say, “Teacher!”",
      "ko": "예수께서 마리아야 하시거늘 마리아가 돌이켜 히브리 말로 랍오니여 하니 (이는 선생님이라)",
      "source_text_hash": "787507d4baf498f7c16d7906aefde83fb49939a636391fb62c3fe673fdf3c1d5",
      "translation_text_hash": "64d08827b0711428c9a9eb7c0d432b8ba83a618c48e15d41b355dfbc3b4d8321",
